{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2004_p", "source_sha256": "dd4d249c366933769cb780d719365f30672204d719dc84a349ff9282c7dfd158", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫です！　今回の公演で\n一番大事なのはあずささんの魅力を伝える事なんです。", "zh": "不用担心！这次公演最重要的，就是展现出梓小姐的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5f64f0037f90ddc1db778d71e8762e1a9e52b5b5bc2c088b05f14ced2116f695", "ja": "必要なのは、あずささんのいろんな表情です。\n新しい魅力が出せるのは、望むところですよ！", "zh": "需要的是展示出您的各种表情，梓小姐。\n能够展现出全新的魅力，正合我意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2006_010azu", "source_sha256": "eecaa096c570b3000e072bf750c2edc702857eb0dd373eb79cbcedec6651c9e0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nでも、本当にいいのかしら……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……  \n但是，真的可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2007_008tak", "source_sha256": "2a5ade1c81450bdfe0ba02e8ad76841af227f89dc4382c5c3c084ba38974a8cb", "ja": "あずさ。希望を聞かせてくれた事、うれしく思います。\n皆で、かわいい公演にしましょう。", "zh": "あずさ。能告诉我你的愿望，我很高兴。  \n让我们大家一起，呈现一场可爱的演出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed76791fdfeb54bd07deba29f2cab5e048759a3fe6031500a1aa67e22a7c49f3", "ja": "あずささんの、アイドルらしいかわいい歌を歌いたい\nっていう気持ち、よくわかります……私、応援します！", "zh": "我很理解，想唱出像梓小姐那样充满偶像风格的可爱歌曲……我会为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2009_010azu", "source_sha256": "2cf0f222b1779df8539a776eba6bded5335f4c3b087cf27624b040dc4c0eb8da", "ja": "貴音ちゃん、風花ちゃん……。", "zh": "贵音、风花……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2010_039kon", "source_sha256": "5fc950170b164936d23ef3f4ab45cdc885d2f395377441b64739c2c914d1ddaa", "ja": "もう、あずさちゃん。\nそれならそうと、早く言ってくれたらよかったのよ？", "zh": "真是的，梓。\n既然这样，早点跟我们说不就好了嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2011_010azu", "source_sha256": "ff8599534cca75eade1ec15685efab9cdaa11acca34f936a66cde7ed5a0ae773", "ja": "ごめんなさいね、このみちゃん。\n恥ずかしくて、どうしても言い出せなくって……。", "zh": "对不起，小此木。\n我太害羞了，实在怎么都说不出口……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2012_010azu", "source_sha256": "da2993f8c57fd577551df5a0f9b058c32cbb5f31a51a58afd845561d5883bce8", "ja": "このみちゃんも莉緒ちゃんも、\n大人っぽい公演を色々考えてくれたのに……。", "zh": "明明木实和莉绪都为我想了各种成熟风格的演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2013_039kon", "source_sha256": "8db4f3646a4fda2f8675344c840ffe3665298d2c6db684387993c87fa111758b", "ja": "あら、謝ることないわよ！　私たちは、\nあずさちゃんと一緒にステージに立ちたいだけだもの！", "zh": "哎呀，没什么好道歉的啦！我们只是想和梓一起站上舞台而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2014_046rio", "source_sha256": "13fe8f8d4f3d1df6e67a3d034c66540e7dac97264ce3722ade63ccc733c08009", "ja": "そうそう！　こっちこそごめんね、あずさちゃん。\n勝手に盛り上がっちゃって。", "zh": "对对！该道歉的是我才对，梓。\n擅自就兴奋起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2015_046rio", "source_sha256": "170ad245fe0628ca7e27ec432062f6d52020a060313dc9f5531cfc48229b04d8", "ja": "あずさちゃんのかわいい歌、楽しみね！　こうなったら\n私も、思いっきりかわいくアピールしてみせるわ！", "zh": "好期待梓的可爱歌曲啊！既然这样，\n我也要尽情展现自己的可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2016_039kon", "source_sha256": "24ceff7d5b1bbce6f9e840a33343bfd1eccc4e46a20f14d320eff96c381178a2", "ja": "だったら、セクシー体操だけじゃなくて、\nカワイイ体操も作らなきゃかしら……？", "zh": "既然这样，看来不能只编性感体操，还得编一套可爱体操才行……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a19b2f7e53be88a8fa22d648044c46b5af813b476f1b1bc5e81c212682479848", "ja": "あっ、でも私、セクシー体操は続けたいです！\nなんだか色々と、引っ込んだ気がするし……。", "zh": "啊，不过我还是想继续做性感体操！总觉得身体各处都收紧了不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2018_008tak", "source_sha256": "874cc41eb7b098e7d7fa903dfebb83b4e43c075c5f57f509538f0642048f5c13", "ja": "そうですね。面妖な体操でしたが……\n体力づくりには、とてもよいと思います。", "zh": "是啊。虽然是很奇怪的体操……\n但我觉得，对锻炼体力非常有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2019_p", "source_sha256": "d2da146e1833bfc8c5251620ab14a56b22ec30ad579e6aff1254313bec5268dc", "ja": "ま、まあ、体操はおいおいで……。\nとにかく、あずささんの希望は聞かせてもらいました。", "zh": "呃、那个，体操之后再说吧……总之，梓小姐的愿望我已经听到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2020_p", "source_sha256": "06833468fab13f15188f2735e947e15bbe4a667dc02b62067b62a091ef9ad4a5", "ja": "みんな、あずささんのセンターが楽しみなんです。\n一緒に頑張りましょう。", "zh": "大家都很期待由梓小姐担任C位呢。\n我们一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2021_010azu", "source_sha256": "41f0c572401717488f85eba6432a8c703a15869c5a11ea19ef139204eacd42e0", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん。\nみんなも……ありがとう。", "zh": "好的，{$P$}先生。\n也谢谢大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2022_null", "source_sha256": "dac177bb88eee3a18c0688d7067a729363b4012c7f9f4ae153245e0556a3feb3", "ja": "公演前日……", "zh": "公演前一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2023_p", "source_sha256": "47b115fe94964e1ae9ce184a2879faba8c8fc48b4f5e83f1c16d95408080fe47", "ja": "（さてと……準備はだいたい整った。あとは明日の\n開演を待つばかり……みんなきっと、驚くだろうな）", "zh": "（好了……准备工作基本都做好了。接下来只要等到明天开演……大家一定会大吃一惊吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2024_010azu", "source_sha256": "142ee7e0526244fb7ce5e2925caab67b09aca31762e6d09ed604a9897925e5bb", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん？\nお疲れさまです～。", "zh": "那个～，{$P$}先生？\n辛苦啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2025_p", "source_sha256": "f9591e1b3b5b1ebc2849c0f88f05e414b94dbe2b1b43f152b4dcf57b6fc9f49c", "ja": "あっ、あずささん、お疲れ様です。\nゲネリハ、バッチリでしたね！", "zh": "啊，梓小姐，辛苦了。\n彩排非常顺利呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2026_010azu", "source_sha256": "17efa23442e97d60accebd9620e8bd66e4e5ef020704d55b0b153ee5859c495b", "ja": "はい、みんなのおかげです。\nみんなしっかりしてて、とっても頼もしくて……。", "zh": "是的，多亏了大家。\n大家都很可靠，让人特别安心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2027_010azu", "source_sha256": "d18b94dd70d8cbb6d86d454177aee8b298e5744ee5bbe388e7c03fcd93e83cb7", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、助けていただいて\nばかりで……本当に、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "也一直受到{$P$}先生的帮助……真的非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2028_p", "source_sha256": "0e63e4eea97b0e0d9fb737e860063f9a5403a2204217c085da7d434ebeda85ec", "ja": "いえ、あずささんの頑張りがあったからこそですよ。\n明日は、いいステージにしましょうね。", "zh": "不，正是因为有了梓小姐的努力啊。明天一起完成一场精彩的演出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2029_010azu", "source_sha256": "fc0b6c63ae85c7ae8744afae172a012788042d4bdd483a933c4ce32f45f91a7a", "ja": "はい……あの、{$P$}さん。\n実は私、まだすこし、不安で……。", "zh": "是的……那个，{$P$}先生。其实，我还有一点不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2030_p", "source_sha256": "eaceb0077219fe84c7bd59cd56759e2a38ba2b07cf6a2760134f385d610e1063", "ja": "不安……ですか？", "zh": "你说不安……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2031_010azu", "source_sha256": "db7b85f1d257120a051dbf241bceef7f94946ad767bd9823e8610ffa7a12001a", "ja": "ええ。レッスンは、十分にしたつもりですけど……\nかわいい曲がメインで、本当によかったんでしょうか？", "zh": "是的。我觉得已经进行了充分的练习，但是……\n以可爱风格的歌曲为主，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2032_010azu", "source_sha256": "3b5266c752f1958efee4ac38b51d67e54b05cbc0616ec49f68153817ad234896", "ja": "なんだか、落ち着かなくて。試しに明日のことを\n占ってみたら、結果があまりよくなくて……。", "zh": "总觉得静不下心来。于是试着占卜了一下明天的运势，结果不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2033_p", "source_sha256": "e6509420f3998b890546ca3d4f1a0c9e627e7c3dea9234cd015922b9b74830de", "ja": "そうだったんですか……。\nでも、きっと大丈夫ですよ。その占いは外れます。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n不过，一定没问题的。那个占卜结果不会应验的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2034_010azu", "source_sha256": "c38c90def47f0f9f2119be2879035c6dd9220022726ffde434366b1b317e6084", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nどうして、そう思うんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n为什么会这么想呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2035_p", "source_sha256": "7502df4ec764178722990fb34b36e315b365107299fc81d4b9103319a267712b", "ja": "そうですね……俺はあずささんみたいに、\n占いをする事はできませんけど……。", "zh": "是啊……我虽然不能像梓小姐那样，\n替人占卜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_053_2036_p", "source_sha256": "bca5979409606c0322201264c2f3b5100db68d20275b0050c399cef2a569c525", "ja": "昨日も今日も、ステージ袖から見たあずささんは、\n星よりも輝いていましたから。自信を持ってください！", "zh": "不管是昨天还是今天，我从舞台侧幕看到的梓小姐，都比星星还要耀眼。请对自己有信心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
